{"id": "q0103", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 867536581, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "The data in the table below shows the percent of bus riders in a survey of Central H.S. students; 300 males and 300 females in each grade were surveyed. For which grade is the number of its male bus riders closest to $135\\%$ of the number of its female bus riders? \\begin{tabular}{|l|c|c|}\\hline\nGrade & Males & Females \\\\ \\hline\n$9^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $41.1\\%$ & $39.4\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$10^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $34.4\\%$ & $33.1\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$11^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $20.6\\%$ & $13.8\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$12^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $11.6\\%$ & $8.6\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n\\end{tabular}\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0103.wav", "input_sha256": "adbc6ffc5dc5203fb5bd83ab83bfe8ae216fcd2142658aed2c0feeef3dc61470", "input_samples": 675000, "input_s": 42.188, "n_real_chunks": 43, "score": 0.8105, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "I’m missing the table of bus-rider percentages. Please provide the table (percent male and female bus riders by grade), and I can compute which grade’s male bus riders is closest to 135% of its female bus riders.", "expert_answer": "I’m missing the table of bus-rider percentages. Please provide the table (percent male and female bus riders by grade), and I can compute which grade’s male bus riders is closest to **135%** of its female bus riders.", "transcript": "The data in the table below shows the percent of bus riders in a survey of Central HS students. 300 males and 300 females in each grade wer